---
// Diseño Tangara Hostel - La Barra, Pacífico Colombiano
// Inspirado en el diseño DC original con mejoras sofisticadas
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
		<title>Tangara Hostel · La Barra, Pacífico colombiano — hostal frente a la playa</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Hostal a 50 metros de la playa de La Barra, Buenaventura. Habitaciones con ventilador y toldillo, internet satelital, café recién hecho. Avistamiento de ballenas de julio a octubre. Desde $50.000 COP por persona." />
		<meta name="theme-color" content="#2F5D50" />
		<style>
			:root {
				--bg: #F4EFE6;
				--bg2: #E9E2D4;
				--ink: #1F2A24;
				--deep: #2F5D50;
				--accent: #E07A5F;
				--accentDark: #C95A3A;
				--rule: #E5D9C9;
				--rule2: #D4C5B9;
				--muted: #5C6B62;
				--faint: #8B9189;
				--onDeep: #F4EFE6;
				--gold: #C9A24B;
			}

			* {
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}

			body {
				margin: 0;
				background: var(--bg);
				color: var(--ink);
				font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
				-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
				line-height: 1.6;
			}

			a {
				color: inherit;
				text-decoration: none;
			}
			a:hover {
				color: var(--accent);
			}

			img, video {
				max-width: 100%;
				display: block;
			}

			/* Ticker */
			.ticker {
				background: var(--deep);
				color: rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.8);
				padding: 9px 2rem;
				display: flex;
				justify-content: space-between;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 16px;
				font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
				font-size: 10.5px;
				letter-spacing: 0.14em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
			}

			.ticker .desktop {
				display: flex;
			}

			.ticker .mobile {
				display: none;
			}

			/* Header */
			header {
				position: sticky;
				top: 0;
				z-index: 40;
				background: rgba(31, 42, 36, 0.93);
				backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
			}

			.header-inner {
				max-width: 1280px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 1rem 2rem;
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: space-between;
				gap: 24px;
			}

			.logo {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 11px;
				min-width: 0;
			}

			.logo img {
				width: 40px;
				height: 40px;
				border-radius: 50%;
				object-fit: cover;
			}

			.logo-text {
				font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
				font-weight: 700;
				font-size: 18px;
				letter-spacing: -0.012em;
				color: var(--onDeep);
				white-space: nowrap;
			}

			nav {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 30px;
				font-size: 14.5px;
				font-weight: 500;
				color: var(--onDeep);
			}

			nav a {
				color: var(--onDeep);
				transition: color 0.2s ease;
			}

			nav a:hover {
				color: var(--accent);
			}

			.header-actions {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 18px;
				margin-left: auto;
			}

			.lang-select {
				display: flex;
				align-items: flex-end;
				gap: 14px;
				font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
				font-size: 11px;
				letter-spacing: 0.1em;
				color: rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.55);
			}

			.lang-btn {
				border: none;
				background: transparent;
				cursor: pointer;
				font: inherit;
				letter-spacing: inherit;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 4px;
				color: rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.6);
				opacity: 0.6;
				transition: all 0.2s;
			}

			.lang-btn.active {
				color: var(--onDeep);
				font-weight: 600;
				opacity: 1;
			}

			.reserve-btn {
				background: var(--accent);
				color: var(--onDeep);
				border-radius: 3px;
				padding: 11px 20px;
				font-size: 14.5px;
				font-weight: 600;
				white-space: nowrap;
				transition: background 0.2s;
			}

			.reserve-btn:hover {
				background: var(--accentDark);
			}

			/* Hero */
			.hero {
				position: relative;
				height: 760px;
				overflow: hidden;
				background: var(--deep);
				padding: 0;
			}

			.hero img {
				position: absolute;
				inset: 0;
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
				object-fit: cover;
			}

			.hero::after {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				inset: 0;
				background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.78) 0%, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.25) 42%, transparent 70%);
			}

			.hero-content {
				position: absolute;
				bottom: 44px;
				left: 44px;
				right: 44px;
				z-index: 1;
				display: flex;
				justify-content: space-between;
				gap: 60px;
				align-items: flex-end;
			}

			.hero-text {
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				gap: 20px;
				color: var(--onDeep);
				max-width: 760px;
			}

			.hero-kicker {
				font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
				font-size: 10.5px;
				letter-spacing: 0.16em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				color: rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.7);
			}

			.hero h1 {
				margin: 0;
				font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
				font-weight: 500;
				font-size: 60px;
				line-height: 0.98;
				letter-spacing: -0.012em;
				text-wrap: pretty;
			}

			.hero-subtitle {
				margin: 0;
				font-size: 34px;
				line-height: 1.1;
				font-weight: 400;
				color: rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.82);
			}

			.hero-body {
				margin: 0;
				font-size: 18px;
				line-height: 1.5;
				color: rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.78);
				max-width: 470px;
			}

			.hero-actions {
				display: flex;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				gap: 16px;
				margin-top: 4px;
			}

			.btn-primary {
				background: var(--accent);
				color: var(--onDeep);
				border-radius: 3px;
				padding: 16px 30px;
				font-size: 16.5px;
				font-weight: 600;
				display: inline-block;
				white-space: nowrap;
				transition: background 0.2s;
			}

			.btn-primary:hover {
				background: var(--accentDark);
			}

			.btn-secondary {
				color: var(--onDeep);
				font-size: 15px;
				border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.4);
				padding-bottom: 2px;
				transition: border-color 0.2s;
			}

			.btn-secondary:hover {
				border-color: var(--onDeep);
			}

			.hero-price {
				text-align: right;
				color: rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.8);
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				gap: 4px;
				flex: none;
			}

			.hero-price-amount {
				font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
				font-size: 34px;
				font-weight: 500;
				letter-spacing: -0.012em;
				color: var(--onDeep);
			}

			.hero-price-label {
				font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
				font-size: 10.5px;
				letter-spacing: 0.14em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
			}

			/* Features */
			.features {
				max-width: 1280px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 96px 2rem;
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
				gap: 56px;
			}

			.feature-card {
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				gap: 18px;
			}

			.feature-card img {
				width: 100%;
				height: 340px;
				object-fit: cover;
				border-radius: 3px;
			}

			.feature-label {
				font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
				font-size: 10.5px;
				letter-spacing: 0.16em;
				color: var(--deep);
				text-transform: uppercase;
			}

			.feature-card h2 {
				margin: 0;
				font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
				font-weight: 500;
				font-size: 38px;
				line-height: 1.04;
				letter-spacing: -0.012em;
			}

			.feature-card p {
				margin: 0;
				max-width: 520px;
				font-size: 16.5px;
				line-height: 1.55;
				color: var(--muted);
			}

			.feature-card a {
				align-self: flex-start;
				font-size: 15px;
				font-weight: 500;
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule2);
				padding-bottom: 2px;
			}

			/* News */
			.news-section {
				background: var(--bg2);
				border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
				padding: 96px 2rem;
			}

			.news-container {
				max-width: 1280px;
				margin: 0 auto;
			}

			.news-header {
				display: flex;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				align-items: baseline;
				justify-content: space-between;
				gap: 16px;
				margin-bottom: 56px;
			}

			.news-header h2 {
				margin: 0;
				font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
				font-weight: 500;
				font-size: 44px;
				letter-spacing: -0.012em;
				text-wrap: pretty;
			}

			.news-header a {
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 9px;
				font-size: 15px;
				font-weight: 500;
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule2);
				padding-bottom: 2px;
			}

			.news-grid {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
				gap: 56px;
			}

			.news-card {
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				gap: 14px;
			}

			.news-card img {
				width: 100%;
				height: 250px;
				object-fit: cover;
				border-radius: 3px;
			}

			.news-meta {
				display: flex;
				gap: 12px;
				align-items: center;
				font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
				font-size: 10.5px;
				letter-spacing: 0.14em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				color: var(--faint);
			}

			.news-tag {
				color: var(--deep);
			}

			.news-card h3 {
				margin: 0;
				font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
				font-weight: 500;
				font-size: 25px;
				line-height: 1.12;
				letter-spacing: -0.012em;
			}

			.news-card p {
				margin: 0;
				font-size: 15px;
				line-height: 1.5;
				color: var(--muted);
			}

			/* Video Band */
			.video-band {
				position: relative;
				min-height: 520px;
				background: var(--deep);
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				gap: 22px;
				text-align: center;
				padding: 80px 2rem;
				overflow: hidden;
			}

			.video-band img {
				position: absolute;
				inset: 0;
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
				object-fit: cover;
				opacity: 0.8;
			}

			.video-band::before {
				content: '';
				position: absolute;
				inset: 0;
				background: rgba(31, 42, 36, 0.45);
				z-index: 1;
			}

			.video-content {
				position: relative;
				z-index: 2;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 22px;
			}

			.play-btn {
				width: 88px;
				height: 88px;
				border-radius: 50%;
				border: 1px solid rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.4);
				background: transparent;
				color: var(--onDeep);
				font-size: 20px;
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				cursor: pointer;
				transition: all 0.2s;
			}

			.play-btn:hover {
				background: var(--accent);
				border-color: var(--deep);
			}

			.video-band h2 {
				margin: 0;
				font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
				font-weight: 500;
				font-size: 56px;
				line-height: 1.02;
				letter-spacing: -0.012em;
				color: var(--onDeep);
			}

			.video-band p {
				margin: 0;
				font-size: 18px;
				line-height: 1.5;
				color: rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.65);
				max-width: 520px;
			}

			/* Footer */
			footer {
				background: var(--bg);
				padding: 72px 2rem 44px;
			}

			.footer-container {
				max-width: 1280px;
				margin: 0 auto;
			}

			.footer-grid {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
				gap: 48px;
				margin-bottom: 56px;
			}

			.footer-brand {
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				gap: 14px;
				align-items: flex-start;
			}

			.footer-logo {
				width: 70px;
				height: 70px;
				border-radius: 50%;
				object-fit: cover;
			}

			.footer-brand h3 {
				margin: 0;
				font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, serif;
				font-weight: 700;
				font-size: 24px;
				letter-spacing: -0.012em;
				color: var(--ink);
			}

			.footer-brand p {
				margin: 0;
				font-size: 15px;
				line-height: 1.55;
				color: var(--muted);
			}

			.footer-col h4 {
				margin: 0 0 11px 0;
				font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
				font-size: 10.5px;
				letter-spacing: 0.14em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				color: var(--faint);
				font-weight: 500;
			}

			.footer-col a {
				display: block;
				font-size: 15px;
				margin-bottom: 11px;
				transition: color 0.2s;
			}

			.footer-col a:last-child {
				margin-bottom: 0;
			}

			.footer-col a:hover {
				color: var(--accent);
			}

			.footer-divider {
				border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
				padding-top: 18px;
				display: flex;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				gap: 10px;
				justify-content: space-between;
				font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
				font-size: 10.5px;
				letter-spacing: 0.12em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				color: var(--faint);
			}

			/* Responsive */
			@media (max-width: 1024px) {
				.features {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
					gap: 48px;
				}

				.news-grid {
					grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
					gap: 40px;
				}

				.footer-grid {
					grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
					gap: 40px;
				}

				nav {
					display: none;
				}

				.hero h1 {
					font-size: 48px;
				}

				.ticker .desktop {
					display: none;
				}

				.ticker .mobile {
					display: flex;
				}
			}

			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.header-inner {
					padding: 1rem;
					gap: 12px;
				}

				.logo-text {
					font-size: 16px;
				}

				.header-actions {
					margin-left: 0;
				}

				.lang-select {
					display: none;
				}

				.hero {
					height: 640px;
				}

				.hero-content {
					flex-direction: column;
					bottom: 20px;
					left: 20px;
					right: 20px;
					align-items: flex-start;
				}

				.hero h1 {
					font-size: 34px;
				}

				.hero-subtitle {
					font-size: 22px;
				}

				.hero-price {
					align-self: flex-start;
					text-align: left;
				}

				.features {
					padding: 56px 1rem;
					gap: 40px;
				}

				.feature-card img {
					height: 240px;
				}

				.feature-card h2 {
					font-size: 30px;
				}

				.news-section {
					padding: 56px 1rem;
				}

				.news-header h2 {
					font-size: 32px;
				}

				.news-grid {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
					gap: 40px;
				}

				.news-card img {
					height: 220px;
				}

				.video-band {
					min-height: 440px;
					padding: 64px 1rem;
				}

				.video-band h2 {
					font-size: 34px;
				}

				.footer-grid {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
					gap: 34px;
				}

				footer {
					padding: 56px 1rem 44px;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<!-- Ticker -->
		<div class="ticker">
			<span class="desktop">Temporada de ballenas · Julio – Octubre</span>
			<span class="desktop">La Barra, Pacífico colombiano · 15 min desde Juanchaco</span>
			<span class="mobile">La Barra, Pacífico Colombiano</span>
		</div>

		<!-- Header -->
		<header>
			<div class="header-inner">
				<a href="#" class="logo">
					<img src="/uploads/702876787_10165380027888900_2312760133940339429_n.jpg" alt="Logo de Tangara Hostel" />
					<span class="logo-text">Tangara Hostel</span>
				</a>
				<nav>
					<a href="#rooms">Habitaciones</a>
					<a href="#whales">Temporada de ballenas</a>
					<a href="#getting">Cómo llegar</a>
					<a href="#news">Noticias</a>
					<a href="#contact">Contacto</a>
				</nav>
				<div class="header-actions">
					<div class="lang-select">
						<button class="lang-btn active">ES</button>
						<button class="lang-btn">EN</button>
						<button class="lang-btn">FR</button>
					</div>
					<a href="#reserve" class="reserve-btn">Reserva</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</header>

		<!-- Hero -->
		<section class="hero">
			<img src="/uploads/IMG-20260420-WA0009.jpg" alt="Atardecer sobre la playa de La Barra, Pacífico colombiano" />
			<div class="hero-content">
				<div class="hero-text">
					<div class="hero-kicker">La Barra · Pacífico Colombiano</div>
					<h1>Hostal frente a la playa en La Barra</h1>
					<p class="hero-subtitle">Tangara, en la costa de las ballenas</p>
					<p class="hero-body">A 50 metros de una playa tranquila del Pacífico colombiano — ventiladores, toldillos, internet satelital de alta velocidad y café recién hecho cada mañana.</p>
					<div class="hero-actions">
						<a href="#reserve" class="btn-primary">Reserva una habitación</a>
						<a href="#availability" class="btn-secondary">Revisa disponibilidad</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="hero-price">
					<div class="hero-price-amount">$50.000</div>
					<div class="hero-price-label">COP · persona / noche</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Features -->
		<section id="rooms" class="features">
			<div class="feature-card">
				<img src="/uploads/IMG-20260406-WA0063.jpg" alt="Hamacas en la terraza de Tangara Hostel" />
				<span class="feature-label">01 — Alojamiento</span>
				<h2>Habitaciones frescas, café al amanecer</h2>
				<p>Habitaciones con ventiladores y toldillos para una noche completamente protegida, y un termo de café recién hecho cada mañana. Internet satelital de alta velocidad y energía disponible, así que puedes trabajar desde aquí.</p>
				<a href="#rooms-detail">Ver las habitaciones</a>
			</div>
			<div class="feature-card">
				<img src="/uploads/IMG-20260420-WA0011.jpg" alt="Camino de entrada al hostal" />
				<span class="feature-label">02 — Experiencias</span>
				<h2>Ballenas, manglares y olas</h2>
				<p>Avistamiento de ballenas y de aves en temporada, senderos eco-turísticos en los estuarios, pesca de pargo en los manglares, y las olas que convirtieron a La Barra en hogar de surfistas legendarios.</p>
				<a href="#whales">Descubre las experiencias</a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- News -->
		<section id="news" class="news-section">
			<div class="news-container">
				<div class="news-header">
					<h2>Historias del Pacífico</h2>
					<a href="#all-news">Ver todas <span class="gold">→</span></a>
				</div>
				<div class="news-grid">
					<a href="#post" class="news-card" style="color: inherit;">
						<img src="/uploads/pexels-juan-felipe-ramirez-312591454-18173772.jpg" alt="Ballena jorobada saltando" />
						<div class="news-meta">
